    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n79256" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρεισ-φέρω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>bring in beside</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. νόμον</span>
